  "post_title": "La rápida intervención impide que el fuego arrase la Serra d'Espadà en Aín",
  "post_date": "2016-04-17 18:19:38",
  "post_name": "la-rapida-intervencion-impide-que-el-fuego-arrase-la-serra-despada-en-ain",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Medio ambiente|Noticias|Sucesos",
  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Tahoma, Verdana; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22.4px;\">(24 fotos) Un incendio en una zona de cultivos abandonados de A&iacute;n ha podido provocar este s&aacute;bado una tragedia forestal en la Serra d&rsquo;Espad&agrave;. La r&aacute;pida intervenci&oacute;n de medios a&eacute;reos, brigadas de emergencias y bomberos ha impedido que el viento propagara el fuego.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Tahoma, Verdana; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22.4px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/04/ComençaIncendiAin.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Tahoma, Verdana; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22.4px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 22.4px;\">El incendio se ha iniciado en una zona de vegetaci&oacute;n sobre las 16.30 horas y</span><span style=\"line-height: 22.4px;\">&nbsp;unas personas que practicaban senderismo por los &Oacute;rganos de Benitand&uacute;s, alarmadas por el humo, han llamdo al 112, seg&uacute;n han relatado al llegar a Suera. La movilizaci&oacute;n de efectivos ha sido instant&aacute;nea.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 22.4px;\">Cinco bomberos volunarios del parque comarcal Espad&aacute;n-Mijares, con sede en Onda , dotados con una autobomba y dos veh&iacute;culos del Consorcio Provincial,una brigada de emergencias de Eslida y otra de Ay&oacute;dar, adem&aacute;s del helic&oacute;ptero y un avi&oacute;n airtractor, han sofocado r&aacute;pidamente las llamas e impedido que se extendieran a la Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave;.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Tahoma, Verdana; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22.4px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 22.4px;\">Finalmente, seg&uacute;n el servicio de informaci&oacute;n audiovisual de bomberos (SIAB), se han calcinado 5.000 m&sup2; de cultivo y una parte de masa forestal (aunque peque&ntilde;a).</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Tahoma, Verdana; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22.4px;\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/comencaincendiain.jpg\" alt=\"comencaincendiain\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0349.jpg\" alt=\"img_0349\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0351.jpg\" alt=\"img_0351\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0352.jpg\" alt=\"img_0352\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0353.jpg\" alt=\"img_0353\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0354.jpg\" alt=\"img_0354\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0355.jpg\" alt=\"img_0355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0357.jpg\" alt=\"img_0357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0358.jpg\" alt=\"img_0358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0359.jpg\" alt=\"img_0359\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0360.jpg\" alt=\"img_0360\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0361.jpg\" alt=\"img_0361\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0362.jpg\" alt=\"img_0362\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0363.jpg\" alt=\"img_0363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0364.jpg\" alt=\"img_0364\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0365.jpg\" alt=\"img_0365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0366.jpg\" alt=\"img_0366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0367.jpg\" alt=\"img_0367\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0368.jpg\" alt=\"img_0368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0369.jpg\" alt=\"img_0369\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0370.jpg\" alt=\"img_0370\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0371.jpg\" alt=\"img_0371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0372.jpg\" alt=\"img_0372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiain160416/img_0373.jpg\"